{"event":"case","case_id":"rag04-followup-03","observation":{"case_id":"rag04-followup-03","status":"completed","route":"rag","latency_ms":17828.999999997905,"request_id":"f11f266c-7df8-4453-82d9-e295df728ae9","latency_scope":"generation_request","response_text":"Para elaborar los vestidos en BELLAARTE BOUTIQUE, se deben seguir estos cinco pasos autorizados:\n\n1.  Confirmar el dise\u00f1o aprobado y tomar las medidas con consentimiento del cliente [S4].\n2.  Separar las piezas por pedido, identificar cada paquete y revisar la disponibilidad del material antes de programar el corte [S5].\n3.  Trazar el patr\u00f3n, cortar \u00fanicamente la tela del pedido identificado y hilvanar las piezas para la primera prueba [S1, S4].\n4.  Realizar la prueba de ajuste; si existen diferencias, corregir antes de proceder a coser las piezas aprobadas [S2].\n5.  Revisar costuras, limpieza y cierre, entregando el producto \u00fanicamente tras la aprobaci\u00f3n final y registrando dicha entrega [S3].","http_status":200,"diagnostics":{"profile":"rag4_v1","route":"documentary","reason":"rag_followup","verdict":"sufficient","outcome":"completed","counts":{"topic_questions":1,"candidates":10,"selected":5,"evidence_bytes":714,"prompt_bytes":2349,"citations":4,"prompt_eval_count":606,"prompt_eval_cached_count":0,"eval_count":172},"durations_seconds":{"embedding_and_release":3.952999999994063,"search":0.0,"context":0.0,"review":5.39100000000326,"first_content":15.656999999991967,"generation":8.171999999991385,"load":4.5108049,"prompt_eval":0.376526,"eval":3.251715,"provider_total":8.1430257,"total":17.828999999997905}},"ram_available_before_bytes":3122966528,"ram_available_after_bytes":3194437632,"human_review":null,"candidate_fragment_ids":["proc-2","proc-3","proc-4","proc-1","work-1","price-1","stock-1","conflict-2","conflict-1","sec-1"],"selected_fragment_ids":["proc-2","proc-3","proc-4","proc-1","work-1"],"sent_fragment_ids":["proc-2","proc-3","proc-4","proc-1","work-1"],"citation_frag